Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is {\c&HC8E6FF&}Lauren.{\c&HFFFFFF&}\NShe loves {\c&HC8E6FF&}Christmas…{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.32,0:00:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but every year,\Nshe has the same {\c&HC8E6FF&}problem.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.99,0:00:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E6FF&}Gifts.{\c&HFFFFFF&} Dinner.\NDecorations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.54,0:00:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,School events. Family plans…\Nshe’s supposed to {\c&HC8E6FF&}remember{\c&HFFFFFF&} all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The closer Christmas gets,\Nthe longer the {\c&HC8E6FF&}list{\c&HFFFFFF&} becomes…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.81,0:00:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and the more {\c&HC8E6FF&}expensive{\c&HFFFFFF&}\Neverything feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.52,0:00:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s planning Christmas\Nfor {\c&HC8E6FF&}everyone{\c&HFFFFFF&} else…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.77,0:00:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but she’s running out of time\Nto actually {\c&HC8E6FF&}enjoy{\c&HFFFFFF&} it herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.63,0:00:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Lauren finds\Na {\c&HC8E6FF&}simpler{\c&HFFFFFF&} way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,to keep Christmas {\c&HC8E6FF&}together.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.41,0:00:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Gifts, budget, meals and plans\Nfinally have a {\c&HC8E6FF&}place…{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.89,0:00:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,so Lauren can\N{\c&HC8E6FF&}enjoy{\c&HFFFFFF&} Christmas too.
